  "description": "The Hareraiser is a 26” wheeled Dirt Jumper (DJ). It is made from trustworthy 100% 4130 chromoly. The frame’s lively feel comes from its ultra-short chainstays and our BMX know-how. You’ll also find integrated chain tensioners, BSA 73mm threaded bottom bracket, and a tapered 1-1/8” to 1-1/2” headtube with removable Gyro tabs.\n\nThe complete Hareraiser FX build features a tough and simple Manitou Circus Expert fork, Odyssey Big Stitch seat, Maxxis 2.3” tires, and durable 19mm, 48 spline chromoly cranks. It is ready to shred out of the box!",
